  "title": "Almond Protein Pancakes with Blueberries",
  "blurb": "Light, fluffy pancakes made with almond flour and protein powder, served with fresh blueberries.",
  "steps": [
    "Crack the egg into a mixing bowl and whisk until smooth.",
    "Add the protein powder, soy flour, almond flour and baking powder, then stir in the water until you have a thick batter.",
    "Heat the coconut oil in a non-stick frying pan over medium heat.",
    "Pour half the batter into the pan to make one pancake, cook for 2 minutes until bubbles appear on the surface, then flip and cook for another 2 minutes.",
    "Repeat with the remaining batter to make a second pancake.",
    "Serve the pancakes topped with the fresh blueberries."
